Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
Sum-of-squares certificates for every \[Theta]: algebraic verification\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"f2974de6-9a1c-4769-8831-4f40be3dc5dc"],

Cell["\<\
Partially entangled Tsirelson family: state \
cos\[Theta]|00\[RightAngleBracket] + sin\[Theta]|11\[RightAngleBracket], \
settings a0 = \[Pi]/4, a1 = -\[Pi]/4, b0 = 0, b1 = \[Pi]/2. For each vertex V \
of the local polygon, the vertex Bell expression \[Beta] (normalised to value \
1 on the optimal realisation) has an SOS certificate valid for all \[Theta] \
in its range (SOS theorem of App. C).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9e27e237-4bb8-422f-98ad-5b94718b1a11"],

Cell["\<\
With v \[Element] (0,1] defined by tan\[Theta] = (\[Sqrt]2 - 1) + (2 - \
\[Sqrt]2) v, i.e. \[Theta] \[Element] (\[Pi]/8, \[Pi]/4], each certificate \
consists of nullifiers N_a(v), a symmetric polynomial matrix W(v) and a \
scalar \[Mu](v) such that

    \[Mu](v) (Id - \[Beta]) = \[Sum]_ab W_ab(v) aj[N_a] ** N_b ,

with W(v) positive definite and \[Mu](v) > 0 on the range. This notebook \
checks, in exact arithmetic: (0) the vertex Bell expressions \[Beta] are the \
Bell expression derived in Orthogonal.nb, evaluated at the vertices; (1) the \
N_a annihilate the optimal state and vanish on the two saturated \
deterministic behaviours; (2) the identity holds as an identity of \
noncommutative polynomials modulo A_x\.b2 = B_y\.b2 = Id and [A_x, B_y] = 0; \
(3) W(v) > 0 and \[Mu](v) > 0 on the range (cylindrical algebraic \
decomposition on the leading principal minors).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"498bf018-a64a-459c-84b3-1c6874e50ed1"],

Cell["NCAlgebra package", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"fe23d359-56ab-4f04-9008-3ad20a90ec6b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"<<", " ", "NCAlgebra`"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"cb4adfe0-ce4c-400c-80af-180d462ff20f"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SetCommutative", "[", 
   RowBox[{
   "v", ",", " ", "rr", ",", " ", "a0", ",", " ", "a1", ",", " ", "b0", ",", 
    " ", "b1"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"SetNonCommutative", "[", 
    RowBox[{"A0", ",", " ", "A1", ",", " ", "B0", ",", " ", "B1"}], "]"}], 
   ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"myRules", " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"A0", " ", "**", " ", "A0"}], " ", "->", " ", "Id"}], ",", 
      "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"A1", " ", "**", " ", "A1"}], " ", "->", " ", "Id"}], ",", 
      "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"B0", " ", "**", " ", "B0"}], " ", "->", " ", "Id"}], ",", 
      "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"B1", " ", "**", " ", "B1"}], " ", "->", " ", "Id"}], ",", 
      "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"B0", " ", "**", " ", "A0"}], " ", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"A0", " ", "**", " ", "B0"}]}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"B0", " ", "**", " ", "A1"}], " ", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"A1", " ", "**", " ", "B0"}]}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"B1", " ", "**", " ", "A0"}], " ", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"A0", " ", "**", " ", "B1"}]}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"B1", " ", "**", " ", "A1"}], " ", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"A1", " ", "**", " ", "B1"}]}]}], "\n", "   ", "}"}]}], ";"}], 
  "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"aj", "[", "A0", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", "A0"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"aj", "[", "A1", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", "A1"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"aj", "[", "B0", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", "B0"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"aj", "[", "B1", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", "B1"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"v", " ", "/:", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "v", "]"}], " ", "=", " ", "v"}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:=",ExpressionUUID->"a9b7d6cb-25ff-4e7b-b019-b3e1f35b6cbf"],

Cell["\<\
As in the \[Theta] = \[Pi]/4 notebook, NCQuadraticForm[vec1, mat, vec2] \
returns \[Sum]_ij aj[vec1_i] ** mat_ij ** vec2_j reduced with myRules. Here \
each product aj[vec1_i] ** vec2_j is reduced first and then combined with the \
scalar entries mat_ij, which is equivalent and much faster.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ae7c97e6-944a-41b8-9d5e-975a58ce246b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"NCQuadraticForm", "[", 
    RowBox[{"vec1_List", ",", " ", "mat_List", ",", " ", "vec2_List"}], "]"}],
    " ", ":=", " ", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"Expand", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Sum", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"mat", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "j"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"NCExpandReplaceRepeated", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"aj", "[", 
           RowBox[{"vec1", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "**", " ", 
          RowBox[{"vec2", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "j", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", "myRules"}], "]"}]}], 
      ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Length", "[", "vec1", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"j", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Length", "[", "vec2", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[3]:=",ExpressionUUID->"049c8b81-bb6e-44a4-9c99-9c3a8e0141a3"],

Cell["Helper functions", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3f68648f-410a-4a64-ba86-3a729d405074"],

Cell["\<\
Operators of the qubit realisation (as in the \[Theta] = \[Pi]/4 notebook) \
and the state |00\[RightAngleBracket] + tan\[Theta] |11\[RightAngleBracket] \
(normalisation is irrelevant):\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"583fbb9b-2fe3-46e7-bae6-b0ff58ac7c0d"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"X", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "1", "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"Z", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"I2", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ZA", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Z", ",", " ", "I2"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"XA", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
    RowBox[{"X", ",", " ", "I2"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ZB", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
    RowBox[{"I2", ",", " ", "Z"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"XB", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
    RowBox[{"I2", ",", " ", "X"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"II", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "4", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"A", "[", "i_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"ZA", " ", "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ")"}], "^", "i"}], " ", "XA"}]}], ")"}], "/", 
    RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "2", "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"B", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "=", " ", "ZB"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"B", "[", "1", "]"}], " ", "=", " ", "XB"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"psi", "[", "v_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "2", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}], " ", 
      "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"2", " ", "-", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "2", "]"}]}], ")"}], " ", "v"}]}]}], "}"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[4]:=",ExpressionUUID->"ddad3096-75f6-4614-9141-75496ac6fb88"],

Cell["\<\
toMatrix turns a noncommutative polynomial into the corresponding 4\[Times]4 \
operator; atDeterministic evaluates it on a deterministic behaviour (A0, A1, \
B0, B1) \[Element] {\[PlusMinus]1}^4; zeroQ decides exactly whether a \
polynomial in v, the monomials and \[Sqrt]2 is zero; leadingMinors returns \
the leading principal minors as polynomials in v.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0cdd78a7-2228-4c1b-bc73-e7291b5be122"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"toMatrix", "[", "expr_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"e", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"NCExpand", "[", "expr", "]"}]}], ",", " ", "c0"}], "}"}], 
      ",", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"c0", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"e", " ", "/.", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"A0", " ", "->", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"A1", " ", "->", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"B0", " ", "->", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"B1", " ", "->", " ", "0"}]}], "}"}]}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"c0", " ", "II"}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"e", " ", "-", " ", "c0"}], ")"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
           RowBox[{"NonCommutativeMultiply", " ", "->", " ", "Dot"}]}], " ", "/.",
           " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"A0", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"A", "[", "0", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"A1", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"A", "[", "1", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"B0", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"B", "[", "0", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"B1", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"B", "[", "1", "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], ")"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
   ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"atDeterministic", "[", 
     RowBox[{"expr_", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"a0v_", ",", " ", "a1v_", ",", " ", "b0v_", ",", " ", "b1v_"}],
        "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", "\n", "  ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"NCExpand", "[", "expr", "]"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
      RowBox[{"NonCommutativeMultiply", " ", "->", " ", "Times"}]}], " ", "/.",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"A0", " ", "->", " ", "a0v"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"A1", " ", "->", " ", "a1v"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"B0", " ", "->", " ", "b0v"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"B1", " ", "->", " ", "b1v"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Id", " ", "->", " ", "1"}]}], "}"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 

 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", "e_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"monos", ",", " ", "com"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"monos", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"DeleteDuplicates", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Cases", "[", 
          RowBox[{"e", ",", " ", "_NonCommutativeMultiply", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "Infinity"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";",
        "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"com", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"e", " ", "/.", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Thread", "[", 
           RowBox[{"monos", " ", "->", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Array", "[", 
             RowBox[{"mm", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Length", "[", "monos", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], " ", 
         "/.", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"A0", " ", "->", " ", "a0"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"A1", " ", "->", " ", "a1"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"B0", " ", "->", " ", "b0"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"B1", " ", "->", " ", "b1"}]}], "}"}]}]}], ";", "\n", 
       "   ", 
       RowBox[{"com", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Expand", "[", 
         RowBox[{"com", " ", "/.", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Power", "[", 
              RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "rr"}], ",", 
            " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Power", "[", 
              RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "/", "2"}]}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"rr", "/", "2"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Expand", "[", 
         RowBox[{"PolynomialRemainder", "[", 
          RowBox[{"com", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"rr", "^", "2"}], " ", "-", " ", "2"}], ",", " ", "rr"}], 
          "]"}], "]"}], " ", "===", " ", "0"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
  "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"leadingMinors", "[", "W_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"Wr", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"W", " ", "/.", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Power", "[", 
            RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "rr"}], ",", 
          " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Power", "[", 
            RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "/", "2"}]}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"rr", "/", "2"}]}]}], "}"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Expand", "[", 
         RowBox[{"PolynomialRemainder", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Expand", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Det", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Wr", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{";;", " ", "k"}], ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{";;", " ", "k"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
           " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"rr", "^", "2"}], " ", "-", " ", "2"}], ",", " ", "rr"}], 
          "]"}], "]"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
        RowBox[{"rr", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "2", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", "W", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[5]:=",ExpressionUUID->"bde453fe-187d-4b5d-9824-5dbb09898c62"],

Cell["Data", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3fe9a597-7f87-47a5-9b8a-18bb9eaddb5d"],

Cell["\<\
The certificates are stored in UniformSOS_data.wl. The next cell loads it \
from the directory of this notebook, so keep the two files together. vbar is \
the value of v at \[Theta]bar, where the hexagon becomes an octagon.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"16b700b2-0c91-4bc2-bb35-240c2f8cf2c7"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SetDirectory", "[", 
   RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory", "[", "]"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Get", "[", "\"\<UniformSOS_data.wl\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Keys", "[", "certs", "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[6]:=",ExpressionUUID->"25758c56-79a8-470a-91da-62b052baf1de"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"\<\"V1\"\>", ",", "\<\"V2\"\>", ",", "\<\"V3\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"V4\"\>", ",", "\<\"V5\"\>", ",", "\<\"V6\"\>"}], "}"}]], "Output",\

 CellLabel->"Out[6]=",ExpressionUUID->"afc30d86-f8ba-4543-bd60-03df2ee0d07f"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"theta", "[", "v_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ArcTan", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "2", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}], " ", "+",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"2", " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "2", "]"}]}], ")"}], " ", "v"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"N", "[", 
    RowBox[{"vbar", ",", " ", "12"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"N", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"theta", "[", "0", "]"}], ",", " ", "12"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"N", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"theta", "[", "vbar", "]"}], ",", " ", "12"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"N", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"theta", "[", "1", "]"}], ",", " ", "12"}], "]"}]}], 
  "}"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[7]:=",ExpressionUUID->"a5d1e4d1-1c50-47c8-8e90-b20da602654c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
  "0.57599531058064468158619320092839188874`12.", ",", 
   "0.39269908169872415480783042290993786052`12.", ",", 
   "0.644539533251754794492792436368478893`12.", ",", 
   "0.78539816339744830961566084581987604996`12."}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[7]=",ExpressionUUID->"e3fbe6f2-fe63-4e6d-b583-38899899667b"],

Cell["Bell expressions: from Orthogonal.nb to the vertices", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"b942cdcf-c451-4829-bf23-b4d768a4aa87"],

Cell["\<\
The plane of Bell expressions is derived in Orthogonal.nb, section SOS \
Decomposition, cell Collect[FullSimplify[Transpose[\[Beta]] . M], {p[1], \
p[4]}]. Its output is pasted below. To check it, evaluate that cell in \
Orthogonal.nb, copy the output and paste it in place of the argument of \
fromOrthogonal. There A[x], B[y] are commuting symbols and A[x] . B[y] are \
their products. fromOrthogonal hides the 4\[Times]4 matrices A[i], B[y] \
defined above, so that the pasted expression is not turned into matrices, and \
rewrites it with the noncommutative variables A0, A1, B0, B1. coeffs returns \
the coefficients of a Bell expression in the order (Id, A0, A1, B0, B1, A0B0, \
A0B1, A1B0, A1B1).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1d73f234-740c-4877-9ac9-6e968a3ae582"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SetAttributes", "[", 
   RowBox[{"fromOrthogonal", ",", " ", "HoldAll"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"fromOrthogonal", "[", "expr_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Block", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"A", ",", " ", "B"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"rules", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"A", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "A0"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"A", "[", "1", "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "A1"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"B", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "B0"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"B", "[", "1", "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "B1"}]}], "}"}]}], 
         "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"expr", " ", "/.", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Dot", "[", 
            RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "y_"}], "]"}], " ", ":>", " ", 
           RowBox[{"NonCommutativeMultiply", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"x", " ", "/.", " ", "rules"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"y", " ", "/.", " ", "rules"}]}], "]"}]}]}], " ", "/.", 
         " ", "rules"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"corrBasis", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
