Cell["\<\
The coordinates of the paper are r0 = p[1] and r1 = 2 p[4]. With tan\[Theta] \
= (\[Sqrt]2 - 1) + (2 - \[Sqrt]2) v, every trigonometric function of \
2\[Theta], 4\[Theta], 6\[Theta] becomes a rational function of v:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a0ff8560-a614-4806-ac9d-efce03d6f9b6"],

