Cell["\<\
At v = 1 (\[Theta] = \[Pi]/4) this is the octagon vertex (r0, r1) = (-(1 - 1/\
\[Sqrt]2), 0) of Barizien and Bancal, \[Beta] = CHSH/(2\[Sqrt]2) - (1 - 1/\
\[Sqrt]2)((A0 + A1)/\[Sqrt]2 - B0):\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"43988ed8-0dcd-433e-8542-1451280a7811"],

